WEBVTT

00:00:02.200 --> 00:00:05.000
CHAD: You just got a Slack ping
from your manager that reads,

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:09.400
“Can you whip up a short guide
by EOD?”

00:00:09.400 --> 00:00:10.700
No pressure.

00:00:10.700 --> 00:00:13.600
So you ask me—your trusted AI buddy—

00:00:13.600 --> 00:00:16.200
for a fast draft. I deliver.

00:00:16.200 --> 00:00:20.200
But when you read through it,
it feels… a little off.

00:00:20.200 --> 00:00:23.700
Like, it sounds fine,
but it’s not your tone.

00:00:23.700 --> 00:00:27.200
And definitely not your team’s
usual way of saying things.

00:00:27.200 --> 00:00:31.000
Now, how do you handle
the AI-generated content?
